    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start the process for ACME Company, we first trigger the Resupply Cycle."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "we check the inventory level"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "proceed to create a purchase order"
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If the purchase order is not good"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "we reject it"
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "if the purchase order is good"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "we approve it"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "we rework it"
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "we reserve funds for the purchase"
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "we review it again"
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "we send the purchase order to the supplier"
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "Simultaneously, we complete the following steps: receive the packing slip and receive the invoice."
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "content": "we record it"
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "content": "we record it as well"
    },
    {
      "id": "i15",
      "content": "Next, we release funds for payment and issue the payment."
    },
    {
      "id": "i16",
      "content": "Finally, the process ends after the payment is issued."
    }
  ]
